# OpenAPI spec is generated, not committed. Emitted by `pnpm codegen` (apps/api
# emit-openapi) and on API boot. Read by gen-catalog + the @openora/mcp query-openapi
# tool, which regenerate/expect it locally (pnpm setup:agent runs codegen).
docs/openapi.json
apps/*/docs/openapi.json
.cache
.claude/worktrees
