.tanstack

# Generated by rulesync from .rulesync/ (single source of truth).
# Regenerated on `pnpm install` (prepare) or `pnpm sync:agents`. Do not commit.
# Root-anchored so per-package AGENTS.md (hand-written) stay tracked.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
# Per-module @AGENTS.md stubs so Claude Code loads the module brief on demand
# (it reads nested CLAUDE.md, not AGENTS.md). Generated by tools/gen/gen-claude-stubs.mjs.
packages/**/CLAUDE.md
extensions/**/CLAUDE.md
apps/**/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
